{"ticker":"YUM","updated":"2026-10-30T23:24:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Yum! Brands, Inc.","shortName":"Yum! Brands, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","country":"United States","website":"https://www.yum.com","fullTimeEmployees":49000,"marketCap":42408828928,"trailingPE":19.571787,"forwardPE":22.722454,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.8622828,"pegRatio":1.96,"targetMeanPrice":170.60909,"targetHighPrice":200.0,"targetLowPrice":147.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.122,"earningsGrowth":1.316,"grossMargins":0.45311,"operatingMargins":0.32779998,"profitMargins":0.25406998,"totalRevenue":8721999872,"beta":0.546,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":170.14,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":134.26,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.94},"summary":"Yum! Brands, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops, operates, and franchises traditional and non-traditional quick service restaurants in the United States, China, and internationally. The company operates in four segments: KFC Division, Taco Bell Division, Pizza Hut Division, and Habit Burger & Grill Division. It also operates restaurants under the KFC, Pizza Hut, Taco Bell, and Habit Burger & Grill brands, which specialize in chicken, Mexican-style food and pizza categories, made-to-order chargrilled burgers, sandwiches, and other products. The company was formerly known as TRICON Global Restaurants, Inc. and changed its name to Yum! Brands, Inc. in May 2002. Yum! Brands, Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky.","summary_zh":"嗯！ Brands, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、中國和國際上開發、經營和特許經營傳統和非傳統快餐店。該公司經營四個部門：肯德基部門、塔可鐘部門、必勝客部門和Habit Burger & Grill部門。該公司還經營肯德基、必勝客、塔可鐘和Habit Burger & Grill品牌的餐廳，專門提供雞肉、墨西哥風味食品和披薩類別、客製化炭烤漢堡、三明治和其他產品。該公司前身為 TRICON Global Dinings, Inc.，後來更名為百勝餐飲集團 (Yum!)。 Brands, Inc.，2002 年 5 月。 味道好極了！ Brands, Inc. 成立於 1997 年，總部位於肯塔基州路易斯維爾。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"餐廳","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":145.27,"h":146.