St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPVDhvOU4tMGh3UWw3cmJwRGE3eUE2MlF2c2g3N3Frb3MtcF84ejVDWUJTdkJNdHRjRVVtaC1PR2x0d2FOUXI2LUNKS3R5WVB0V2FOcjN1VE5jc010Z2pTcUx1TDBvNFdQdTJ3VHZzUWhGWVl0dzNrNzNjTVlzeWQ1VFRDTk52aFhGXzF2eWYwLXJYb25xUTZCZW9MQlI2SF96NXBVVHVQZG1hVVNDeTBvOXItQ1I?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"麥當勞 vs 百勝餐飲集團品牌：哪個速食股利有較大的成長空間？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1041061/000104106126000084/yum-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Yum! Brands, Inc. (referred to herein as \"YUM\", the \"Registrant\" or the \"Company\"), was incorporated under the laws of the state of North Carolina in 1997. The principal executive offices of YUM are located at 1441 Gardiner Lane, Louisville, Kentucky 40213, and the telephone number at that location is (502) 874-8300. Our website address is https://www.yum.com.","zh":"嗯！ Brands, Inc.（本文稱為「YUM」、「註冊人」或「本公司」）於 1997 年根據北卡羅來納州法律成立。 YUM 的主要執行辦公室位於 1441 Gardiner Lane, Louisville, Kentucky 40213，該地點的電話號碼為 (502) 874-8300。我們的網址是 https://www.yum.com。"},{"en":"YUM, together with its subsidiaries, is referred to in this Form 10-K annual report (\"Form 10-K\") as the Company. The terms \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" are also used in the Form 10-K to refer to the Company. Throughout this Form 10-K, the terms \"restaurants,\" \"stores\" and \"units\" are used interchangeably. While YUM does not directly own or operate any restaurants, throughout this document we may refer to restaurants that are owned or operated by our subsidiaries as being Company-owned.","zh":"百勝餐飲集團及其子公司在本 10-K 表格年度報告（「10-K 表格」）中統稱為「本公司」。表格 10-K 中也使用術語「我們」和「我們的」來指稱公司。在本表 10-K 中，術語「餐廳」、「商店」和「單位」可以互換使用。雖然百勝餐飲不直接擁有或經營任何餐廳，但在本文件中，我們可能將我們子公司擁有或經營的餐廳稱為公司擁有的餐廳。"},{"en":"YUM has over 63,000 restaurants in 155 countries and territories primarily operating under the four concepts of KFC, Taco Bell, Pizza Hut and Habit Burger & Grill (the \"Concepts\"). The Company's KFC, Taco Bell and Pizza Hut brands are global leaders of the chicken, Mexican-inspired food and pizza categories, respectively. Habit Burger & Grill is a fast-casual restaurant concept specializing in made-to-order chargrilled burgers, sandwiches and more. At December 31, 2025, 97% of our Concepts' units are operated by independent franchisees or licensees under the terms of franchise or license agreements. The terms franchise or franchisee within this Form 10-K are meant to describe third parties that operate units under either franchise or license agreements.","zh":"百勝餐飲集團在 155 個國家和地區擁有超過 63,000 家餐廳，主要以肯德基、塔可鐘、必勝客和 Habit Burger & Grill（「概念」）這四個概念經營。該公司的肯德基、塔可鐘和必勝客品牌分別是雞肉、墨西哥風味食品和披薩類別的全球領導者。 Habit Burger & Grill 是一家休閒快餐概念餐廳，專門提供客製化炭烤漢堡、三明治等。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們 97% 的 Concepts 單位由獨立特許經營商或被授權人根據特許經營或授權協議條款營運。本表格 10-K 中的術語特許經營權或特許經營者旨在描述根據特許經營或許可協議經營單位的第三方。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The retail food industry, in which our Concepts compete, is made up of supermarkets, supercenters, warehouse stores, convenience stores, coffee shops, snack bars, delicatessens and restaurants (including those in the QSR segment), and is intensely competitive with respect to price and quality of food products, new product development, digital engagement, advertising levels and promotional initiatives, customer service reputation, restaurant location and attractiveness and maintenance of properties. Competition has also increased from and been enabled by delivery aggregators and other food delivery services in recent years, particularly in urbanized areas. Our Concepts also face competition as a result of convergence in grocery, convenience, deli and restaurant services, including the offering by the grocery industry of convenient meals, including pizzas and entrees with side dishes. The ","zh":"我們的概念所競爭的零售食品行業由超市、超級中心、倉儲店、便利店、咖啡店、小吃店、熟食店和餐館（包括 QSR 領域的餐館）組成，在食品價格和質量、新產品開發、數位參與、廣告水平和促銷活動、客戶服務聲譽、餐廳位置以及吸引力和物業維護方面競爭激烈。近年來，配送聚合商和其他食品配送服務的競爭也日益加劇，尤其是在都市化地區。由於雜貨、便利、熟食和餐廳服務的融合，我們的概念也面臨著競爭，包括雜貨業提供的方便餐，包括比薩和配菜主菜。這"}],"competition":[{"en":"The retail food industry, in which our Concepts compete, is made up of supermarkets, supercenters, warehouse stores, convenience stores, coffee shops, snack bars, delicatessens and restaurants (including those in the QSR segment), and is intensely competitive with respect to price and quality of food products, new product development, digital engagement, advertising levels and promotional initiatives, customer service reputation, restaurant location and attractiveness and maintenance of properties. Competition has also increased from and been enabled by delivery aggregators and other food delivery services in recent years, particularly in urbanized areas. Our Concepts also face competition as a result of convergence in grocery, convenience, deli and restaurant services, including the offering by the grocery industry of convenient meals, including pizzas and entrees with side dishes. The ","zh":"我們的概念所競爭的零售食品行業由超市、超級中心、倉儲店、便利店、咖啡店、小吃店、熟食店和餐館（包括 QSR 領域的餐館）組成，在食品價格和質量、新產品開發、數位參與、廣告水平和促銷活動、客戶服務聲譽、餐廳位置以及吸引力和物業維護方面競爭激烈。近年來，配送聚合商和其他食品配送服務的競爭也日益加劇，尤其是在都市化地區。由於雜貨、便利、熟食和餐廳服務的融合，我們的概念也面臨著競爭，包括雜貨業提供的方便餐，包括比薩和配菜主菜。這"},{"en":"The Company is not aware of any federal, state or local environmental laws or regulations that will materially affect our earnings or competitive position, or result in material capital expenditures. However, the Company cannot predict the effect on our operations due to possible future environmental legislation or regulations. During 2025, there were no material capital expenditures for environmental control facilities and no such material expenditures are anticipated.","zh":"本公司不知道任何聯邦、州或地方環境法律或法規會對我們的收入或競爭地位產生重大影響，或導致重大資本支出。然而，由於未來可能的環境立法或法規，公司無法預測對我們營運的影響。 2025年期間，環境控制設施沒有重大資本支出，預計也不會發生此類重大支出。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Division","val":8220000000,"zh":"總除法"},{"name":"KFC Global Division","val":3542000000,"zh":"肯德基全球事業部"},{"name":"Taco Bell Global Division","val":3095000000,"zh":"塔可鐘全球分部"},{"name":"Other","val":2668000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"Pizza Hut Global Division","val":1013000000,"zh":"必勝客全球事業部"},{"name":"The Habit Burger Grill Global Division","val":570000000,"zh":"Habit Burger Grill 全球分部"},{"name":"PH Strategic Options","val":7000000,"zh":"PH 策略選擇"}],"total":8214000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Franchiseandpropertyrevenue","val":3473000000,"zh":"Franchiseandpropertyrevenue"},{"name":"Product","val":2945000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Advertising","val":1796000000,"zh":"廣告"}],"total":8214000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4525000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"GB","val":1021000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":8214000000}},"peers":["DRI","YUMC","PEP","WEN","DPZ"]}}